# one.com

> one.com is a European web hosting provider. Individuals and businesses use one.com for creating a professional website or ecommerce store, registering domains and email, and hosting their projects.

## Website Builder

- [Website Builder](https://www.one.com/en-gb/websitebuilder/): AI Website Builder. Chat to create and refine a website. No coding required.
- [Online Shop](https://www.one.com/en-gb/online-shop/): E-commerce functionality with product management and payment integration.
- [Bookings](https://www.one.com/en-gb/website/bookings/): Online appointment booking for service businesses.

## WordPress

- [WordPress Hosting](https://www.one.com/en-gb/wordpress-hosting/): WordPress hosting with 1-click install.
- [AI Website Builder for WordPress](https://www.one.com/en-gb/wordpress-hosting/ai-website-builder-for-wordpress/): Launch a WordPress site in minutes using Aida AI.
- [Managed WordPress](https://www.one.com/en-gb/wordpress-hosting/managed-wordpress/): Fully managed WordPress with priority support.
- [Rank Math](https://www.one.com/en-gb/wordpress-hosting/rankmath/): SEO plugin for WordPress.
- [WP Rocket](https://www.one.com/en-gb/wordpress-hosting/wp-rocket/): Performance and caching plugin for WordPress.

## Domains

- [Domain Registration](https://www.one.com/en-gb/domain/): Register domain names across hundreds of TLDs.
- [Domain Transfer](https://www.one.com/en-gb/domain/domain-transfer/): Transfer an existing domain to one.com.

## Web Hosting

- [Web Hosting](https://www.one.com/en-gb/hosting/): Shared hosting plans with website tools, SSL, and email included.
- [VPS](https://www.one.com/en-gb/vps/): Virtual private servers for full control over the server environment.
- [Managed VPS](https://www.one.com/en-gb/vps/managed/): VPS with server management handled by one.com.

## Email

- [Email Hosting](https://www.one.com/en-gb/email/): Professional email on a custom domain. Ad-free with spam filtering and webmail.
- [Microsoft 365](https://www.one.com/en-gb/microsoft-office-365/): Microsoft 365 plans with various office apps.

## Marketing

- [MiniCRM](https://www.one.com/en-gb/online-marketing/minicrm/): CRM tool to manage customer relationships.
